# Note: The cached dataset files (data/train.csv: ~3.1MB, data/test.csv: ~2.4MB)
# and model (data/best_model.pkl: ~2.4KB) are under GitHub's 50MB file size limit.
# Keeping them tracked allows your teammates and guide to run `live` and `make_plots.py`
# instantly without waiting 30-60 minutes to re-download from NASA JSOC.
